========================================================================
  STEP 2 — tools/list (discovery)
========================================================================
JSON-RPC request: method="tools/list" — the agent asks what it is allowed to do.
- list_requirements: List every requirement of the kata with its id, title, and implementation status.
- get_requirement: Get the user story and acceptance criteria for one requirement.
- validate_spec: Validate the requirements spec on disk.
- refine_requirement: Review one requirement's wording for quality: ambiguous language, a story missing its actor or rationale, outcomes that are not measurable, criteria covering more than one action, and missing edge cases.
- run_tests: Run the kata test suite with Maven and report the outcome.
- get_tdd_state: Get the current phase of the Red/Green/Refactor cycle, the last test run summary, and a suggested next step.
- start_refactor: Begin a refactor step.

